# .dockerignore — M1 closer.
#
# Without this file, every `docker build` would copy the full working tree
# into the build context: node_modules (heavy), .git (full history),
# coverage reports, local secrets, the entire test suite, IDE state. That
# inflates the build, slows the cold cache, leaks workstation state into
# every image layer, and (worst) risks copying a developer's local
# `.env`-style file into the published image.
#
# The Dockerfile only needs: package.json + package-lock.json + tsconfig.json
# + src/. Everything else is either redundant (rebuilt by `npm ci`) or
# noise.

# ---- Version control -------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# ---- Dependency directories rebuilt by `npm ci` ----------------------------
node_modules
**/node_modules

# ---- Build output (Dockerfile compiles fresh) ------------------------------
dist
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---- Test artefacts, fixtures, and the test tree itself --------------------
# The image runs production code, not tests; coverage reports and example
# fixtures should never end up baked into a layer.
tests
coverage
reports
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
__snapshots__
.vitest

# ---- Local developer ergonomics --------------------------------------------
.husky
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
.cache

# ---- Local config / secrets — defensive belt -------------------------------
# We do NOT commit these (`.gitignore` already blocks them) but a developer
# may have an untracked copy on disk during a build. Belt + braces.
.env
.env.*
*.local
secrets/
credentials/
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# ---- Docs / packaging metadata not needed at runtime -----------------------
docs
examples
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
SECURITY.md
.editorconfig
.prettierrc*
.eslintrc*
eslint.config.*
jscpd.json
configs

# ---- npm + tarball droppings -----------------------------------------------
*.tgz
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ---- Dockerfile itself never needed inside the image ----------------------
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# ---- CI/runtime ephemerals -------------------------------------------------
junit*.xml
*.junit.xml
